#. Apply and delete context-menu actions, ../../manual/editors/outliner/usage.rst:62.
msgid "You can apply and delete items using the context menu."
msgstr "Du kan tillämpa och radera objekt med hjälp av kontextmenyn."

#. 3D Viewport drag-and-drop heading, ../../manual/editors/outliner/usage.rst:66.
msgid "Drag & Dropping to 3D Viewport"
msgstr "Dra och släpp till 3D-vyporten"

#. Object drag creates duplicate, ../../manual/editors/outliner/usage.rst:68.
msgid ""
"Dragging an object from the Outliner to the :doc:`3D Viewport "
"</editors/3dview/index>` creates a :doc:`duplicate "
"</scene_layout/object/editing/duplicate>` -- a new object with its own "
"copy of the underlying object data."
msgstr ""
"När du drar ett objekt från Outliner till :doc:`3D-vyporten "
"</editors/3dview/index>` skapas en :doc:`dubblett "
"</scene_layout/object/editing/duplicate>` -- ett nytt objekt med en egen "
"kopia av den underliggande objektdatan."

#. Object-data drag creates linked duplicate, ../../manual/editors/outliner/usage.rst:72.
msgid ""
"Dragging object data from the Outliner to the 3D Viewport creates a "
":doc:`linked duplicate </scene_layout/object/editing/duplicate_linked>` "
"-- a new object that references the same underlying object data."
msgstr ""
"När du drar objektdata från Outliner till 3D-vyporten skapas en "
":doc:`länkad dubblett </scene_layout/object/editing/duplicate_linked>` -- "
"ett nytt objekt som refererar till samma underliggande objektdata."
